                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "They continue to advertise the game as interactive between viewers and the streamer. Apparently the online service has been closed for some time now! Requested a refund considering the only reason I got it was including chat when streaming. I wouldnt recommend it considering hey! Look at that! The very first thing in the game description; \"Special feature for streamers and their audience!\" Oh! Look at that in the quick game summary; \"-audience is virtual or real with revolutionary but optional features for streamers and their fans.\"\n\nChange your descriptions or I think everyone should request a refund on the grounds of false advertisement alone.",
